/**
 * 
 * Action for loading an image onto the screen.
 * 
 * <pre>
 * 
 * SOFTWARE HISTORY
 * 
 * Date          Ticket#  Engineer    Description
 * ------------- -------- ----------- --------------------------
 * Jan 15, 2014  2313     bsteffen    Initial creation
 * 
